{"title":"Moonfane Moth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 39 Moth that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 12 times (5.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonwing-dust\">Moonwing Dust</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>57</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>43</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>67</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>48</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>188</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>233</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>209</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>186</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>112</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>243</span></a><a cla